  "bodyHash": "bc2dc533a7ec37b8",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔注入器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 新增了一个附魔台，让你能够精确选择要应用的附魔，而不是依赖随机结果。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基础附魔注入器专为简单的附魔操作设计，而高级附魔注入器则可以修改现有附魔、使用经验值修复物品，并从不需要的附魔中回收经验值。🔮</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">书架的作用与原版附魔台完全相同，随着你的配置升级，将解锁更强的附魔。📚 费用、附魔可用性、宝藏附魔、修复功能以及许多其他机制均可完全自定义，以符合你偏好的成长风格。🎛️</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">选择你的附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 精确选择要应用的附魔，不再依赖随机附魔结果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">书架进阶：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 围绕注入器搭建附魔设施，以解锁更强的附魔和更高的等级。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">两种注入器层级：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用基础注入器进行简单附魔，或升级至高级注入器以获取额外功能和更低费用。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">修改现有装备：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用高级注入器升级、移除和调整已附魔物品的附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用经验修复：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接使用经验值恢复耐久度，无需消耗修复材料。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">♻️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">回收经验：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 解除不需要的附魔并返还经验，类似于磨石的功能。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔书籍：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接通过注入器制作附魔书，打造你的完美藏书。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扩展附魔选项：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可选择允许通常仅限铁砧使用的附魔，例如给斧头添加锋利附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎛️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自定义费用、书架需求、修复方式、可用附魔等更多内容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔说明：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 安装 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enchantment Insights</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模组，即可在注入器界面内直接查看附魔说明。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cATWWPwhay4\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></iframe></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric 与 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可通过游戏内的模组菜单直接进行配置（在 Fabric 上需要安装 Prospector 的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目录下，文件名分别为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freyadono\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Freyadono</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 创作了原版《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-plus\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enchanting Plus</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">》模组，我多年前非常喜爱游玩，该模组也为本项目提供了大量灵感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/releasehun\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">releaseHUN</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 为本模组制作了精美的纹理素材。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lorddeathunter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">LordDeatHunter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Wraith Waystones</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">》模组，本项目的部分附魔注入器界面设计深受其启发。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shxrkie\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SHXRKIE</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在整个开发过程中提供的所有帮助与反馈。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/climate-rivers\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mindful-darkness\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mindfuldarkness/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
